       EEBBAADDFF  _f_d is not a valid file descriptor.

       EEFFAAUULLTT _n_p_c is not a valid pointer, or _e_v_e_n_t is non‐NULL and an  invalid
              pointer.

       EEIINNTTRR  A  signal  occurred  while  ssppuu__rruunn()  was in progress; see ssiigg‐‐
